# SaveWise Frontend

## Overview

SaveWise is a smart savings assistant application designed to help users manage their expenses and develop better saving habits through intelligent transaction tracking and spare-change savings.

This repository contains the frontend implementation of SaveWise, providing the user interface for interacting with the application. The frontend connects with the Flask backend to send and retrieve transaction data.

## Features

- Modern and simple user interface
- Interactive savings dashboard
- Add transaction functionality
- Display transaction details
- Expense tracking interface
- Backend API integration
- Responsive webpage design
- Easy-to-use navigation

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

